/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 85 0 R
/E (Companies undergo a 409a so they can maintain a safe harbor status, which is conducted by a third party valuation service provider. This safeguards the company from onerous IRS penalties placed on the shareholders of the company in case the FMV of the company is inaccurate.)
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [11 202 0 R 13]
>>
